# language_tuple.plan: the autopilot plan the language_tuple_judge drives -- title -> START -> main menu -> NEW GAME ->
# create the save (slot 1) -> the intro movie H01_A opens (the Player logs its sound track) -> skipped at once -> StartingPlay ->
# the hub, Playing (the level's voices and the hub's title card read) -> a short wait -> stop. The menu prefix is
# hub_entry.plan's, anchored on the GameController states (the drive model moves the loads). A plan, not a pad log: it holds
# under every language (the text and speech banks differ in size per language, so a recorded log's boundaries would not).
until-gstate 7 3000
idle 11
hold START 5
until-gstate 8 300
idle 128
hold CROSS 5
idle 295
hold UP 3
idle 97
hold CROSS 3
idle 247
hold DOWN 3
idle 67
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 14 3000
idle 150
hold CROSS 5
until-gstate 12 3000
idle 151
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 12 200
idle 60
stop
